            <description>&lt;img src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/img/top_proto0.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Featured image of post First production with the prototype&#34; /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;september-5-2021&#34;&gt;September 5, 2021&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;I cloned 36 basil clones and started waiting for roots to develop.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/plate_proto.jpg&#34;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;alt=&#34;Side view&#34;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;p&gt;Side view&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Evolution from September 14th to september 26th:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;figure &gt;&#xA;        &#xA;            &lt;img src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/bas_fin_1.jpeg&#34;  style=&#34;border: 4px solid black; vertical-align:middle&#34; alt=&#34;Difference between the mother and the clone heads !&#34; /&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &lt;figcaption&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;&#xA;            Difference between the mother and the clone heads !&#xA;            &#xA;                &#xA;            &#xA;            &lt;/p&gt; &#xA;        &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;    &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;figure &gt;&#xA;        &#xA;            &lt;img src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/bas_fin_3.jpeg&#34;  style=&#34;border: 4px solid black; vertical-align:middle&#34; alt=&#34;September: 14th, 19th, 21st, 23rd, 26th&#34; /&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &lt;figcaption&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;&#xA;            September: 14th, 19th, 21st, 23rd, 26th&#xA;            &#xA;                &#xA;            &#xA;            &lt;/p&gt; &#xA;        &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;    &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;figure &gt;&#xA;        &#xA;            &lt;img src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/bas_fin_2.jpeg&#34;  style=&#34;border: 4px solid black; vertical-align:middle&#34; alt=&#34;Plants just before the first harvest September 30th&#34; /&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &lt;figcaption&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;&#xA;            Plants just before the first harvest September 30th&#xA;            &#xA;                &#xA;            &#xA;            &lt;/p&gt; &#xA;        &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;    &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;figure &gt;&#xA;        &#xA;            &lt;img src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/bas_4_o.jpg&#34;  style=&#34;border: 4px solid black; vertical-align:middle&#34; alt=&#34;Plants the day before the second harvest October 4th&#34; /&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &lt;figcaption&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;&#xA;            Plants the day before the second harvest October 4th&#xA;            &#xA;                &#xA;            &#xA;            &lt;/p&gt; &#xA;        &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;    &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;figure &gt;&#xA;        &#xA;            &lt;img src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/bas_5_o.jpg&#34;  style=&#34;border: 4px solid black; vertical-align:middle&#34; alt=&#34;Leves from the second harvest&#34; /&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &lt;figcaption&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;&#xA;            Leves from the second harvest&#xA;            &#xA;                &#xA;            &#xA;            &lt;/p&gt; &#xA;        &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;    &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;figure &gt;&#xA;        &#xA;            &lt;img src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/bas_4_o2.jpg&#34;  style=&#34;border: 4px solid black; vertical-align:middle&#34; alt=&#34;Pesto batch&#34; /&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &lt;figcaption&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;&#xA;            Pesto batch&#xA;            &#xA;                &#xA;            &#xA;            &lt;/p&gt; &#xA;        &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;        